# "during/in" preposition governing a calendar period ("during 2030" /
# "during January"), distinct from marker_in.voc's future-offset "in N
# units" sense ("след 5 дни"), which is a different Bulgarian word.
# "през": en.wiktionary.org, entry "през" (Bulgarian section) -- senses
# "through, via" and "during, in the course of". "в" is the same locative
# preposition already attested by marker_at.voc/marker_of.voc in this
# locale ("в 2030" = "in 2030").
през
в
